rporation (SANM). This chart runs from Oct 24, 2025 to Mar 5, 2026.","setup":"The stock rose about 65% in the three months before the base. It then formed a base for about 10 weeks, peaking at $178.39 and pulling back 21% at its deepest. Daily price ranges tightened on the right side of the base.","outcome":"On Jan 21, 2026 it closed at $181.17, its first close above the base high of $178.39. Volume that day was 563K shares, 1.00x the prior 10-day average of 561K. It didn't hold. By Jan 29, 2026 it had closed below the breakout level three days running, and the chart ends at $130.29.","lesson":"This is an example of a false breakout. Volume on the breakout day was light, and that tell was visible before the move fell apart. Cutting it early was a good read."}}